#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Blockspire is a fast, accessible, multipurpose WordPress block theme for businesses, agencies, blogs, portfolios and online stores. Built entirely for full site editing, it ships a complete template hierarchy, a large pattern library, several style variations and themed WooCommerce templates, so you can assemble a polished site in the Site Editor without writing code. Self-hosted fonts, no external requests and no page-builder dependency keep it quick and private."
msgstr ""

