#: patterns/faq-two-column.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "FAQ with a sidebar introduction"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-two-column.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "An introduction and a way to get in touch on the left, with the expandable questions stacked on the right."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-two-column.php:16
msgid "Do you work with businesses outside your region?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-two-column.php:17
msgid "Most of our clients are, and always have been, somewhere else. We keep overlapping hours and write things down, which turns out to matter more than sharing a postcode."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-two-column.php:20
msgid "Who owns the code you write?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-two-column.php:21
msgid "You do, from the first commit. We hand over the repository at the end of every project whether or not you carry on working with us."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-two-column.php:24
msgid "Can you take over a project someone else started?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-two-column.php:25
msgid "Frequently. We begin with a short paid audit so we can tell you honestly what shape it is in before either of us commits to anything larger."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-two-column.php:28
msgid "How do you charge?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-two-column.php:29
msgid "Fixed price for defined work, a monthly retainer for ongoing care. We do not bill by the hour, because it rewards the wrong thing."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-two-column.php:38
#: patterns/faq.php:37
msgid "FAQ"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-two-column.php:42
